    <string name="settings_sync_code_warning">Le khodi yokubuyisela iwukuphela kokhiye wamabhukumaka akho avumelanisiwe. Yilondoloze kumphathi wakho wamaphasiwedi — noma kwenye indawo ephephile. Ngeke ibuyiselwe uma ilahleka.</string>
