    <string name="settings_sync_delete_message">Lokhu kususa unomphela amabhukumaka akho abethelwe kuseva futhi kuvale ukuvumelanisa kule divayisi. Amabhukumaka kule divayisi agcinwa. Lokhu ngeke kuhlehliswe — ezinye izidivayisi ngeke zisakwazi ukubuyisela kuseva.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_delete_started">Isusa idatha yakho kuseva…</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_delete_summary">Susa unomphela amabhukumaka akho abethelwe kuseva</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_delete_title">Susa idatha kuseva</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_caveat_message">Leli fayela lilondolozwe lingabethelwe — noma ngubani ongalifunda angafunda amabhukumaka akho. Ngenisa ikhodi kumphathi wakho wamaphasiwedi (noma kwenye indawo ephephile), bese ususa ifayela. Umphathi wamaphasiwedi uyligcina libethelwe; ifayela elixegayo alikwenzi lokho.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_continue">Qhubeka</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_done">Ikhodi yokubuyisela ilondoloziwe</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_failed">Ayikwazanga ukulondoloza ifayela</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_file_body">Firedown — ikhodi yokubuyisela ukuvumelanisa amabhukumaka\n\n%1$s\n\nLe khodi iwukuphela kokhiye wamabhukumaka akho avumelanisiwe — noma ngubani onayo angawafunda, futhi ngeke ibuyiselwe uma ilahleka.\n\nLeli fayela ALIBETHELWANGA. Ngenisa ikhodi kumphathi wakho wamaphasiwedi (noma kwenye indawo ephephile), bese ususa leli fayela.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_summary">Thumbela ikhodi njengefayela lombhalo ongaligcina</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_export_title">Londoloza ikhodi yokubuyisela kufayela</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_faq_a1">Yebo. Ibhukumaka ngalinye libethelwa kule divayisi ngaphambi kokuba lilayishwe. Iseva igcina kuphela idatha edidekile engakwazi ukuyifunda.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_faq_a2">Cha. Ikhodi yakho yokubuyisela kuphela engavula amabhukumaka akho. Abethelwe ukusuka ekuqaleni kuya ekugcineni, akukho lutho lomuntu siqu olunamathiselwe, futhi iseva ayiyiboni neze idatha engadidekile.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_faq_a3">Ukhiye okhiqizwa kudivayisi yakho lapho uvula ukuvumelanisa. Yiyona kuphela into engavula amabhukumaka akho — kule divayisi noma kweyentsha.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_faq_a4">Amabhukumaka akho avumelanisiwe ngeke abuyiselwe — hhayi nguwe, futhi hhayi yithi, ngoba asikaze sibe nokhiye. Akukho ukusetha kabusha kwephasiwedi. Londoloza ikhodi endaweni ephephile; umphathi wamaphasiwedi ungcono.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_faq_a5">Cha. Akukho ukubhalisa, i-imeyili, noma inombolo yefoni — ikhodi yokubuyisela kuphela. Akukho lutho lomuntu siqu oluboshelwe emabhukumakeni akho.</string>
    <string name="settings_sync_faq_a6">Ukuvumelanisa kuyazikhethela futhi kuvaliwe ngokuzenzakalela. Ungalokhu uthumbela amabhukumaka akho kufayela bese uwangenisa kamuva, ngaphandle kweseva.</string>
